%!PS-Adobe-3.0
%%Title: peek PostScript sample
%%Creator: peek test suite
%%For: peek
%%CreationDate: 2026-05-30
%%LanguageLevel: 2
%%BoundingBox: 0 0 612 792
%%Pages: 2
%%EndComments
%%Page: 1 1
% --- Page 1: title, a filled rectangle, and a circle ---
/Helvetica-Bold findfont 34 scalefont setfont
0.10 0.20 0.55 setrgbcolor
72 700 moveto (peek - PostScript page 1) show

0.90 0.45 0.10 setrgbcolor
72 480 200 140 rectfill

0.05 0.55 0.30 setrgbcolor
380 360 90 0 360 arc fill

0 0 0 setrgbcolor
4 setlinewidth
72 120 moveto 540 120 lineto stroke
showpage
%%Page: 2 2
% --- Page 2: peek renders only page 1, so this is here to prove it ---
/Helvetica findfont 26 scalefont setfont
0 0 0 setrgbcolor
72 700 moveto (page 2 - not the default render) show
showpage
%%EOF
